      "observed": "The AVR-ISP-6 header J7 pin 3 (SCK) is on net NET0002, which connects only to J3 pin 4 (FAN). The ATtiny45 U3 pin 7 (PB2/SCK) and ATtiny13 U4 pin 7 (PB2/SCK) are on net NET0003, which connects to J1 pin 2 (POT) and J4 pin 3 (I2C SCL). There is no connection between NET0002 and NET0003.",
